CEC Entertainment, parent company of Chuck E. Cheese and Peter Piper Pizza, has named Scott Drake as president and chief executive officer, effective Feb. 13. He succeeds David McKillips, who has served in the role since January 2020.&nbsp;

Drake joined the company in 2024 as chief financial officer following senior leadership roles at Farmer Brothers Coffee Co., GameStop, 7-Eleven, La Madeleine, and Coca-Cola
